{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17228","headline":"奉和李大夫题郑评事江楼 · 权德舆","name":"奉和李大夫题郑评事江楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"达士无外累，隐几依南郭。\n茅栋上江开，布帆当砌落。\n支颐散华发，欹枕曝灵药。\n入鸟不乱行，观鱼还自乐。\n何时金马诏，早岁建安作。\n往事尽筌蹄，虚怀寄杯杓。\n邦君驻千骑，清论时间酌。\n凭槛出烟埃，振衣向寥廓。\n心源齐彼是，人境胜岩壑。\n何必栖冥冥，然爲避矰缴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}